research and publications in the field of medical sciences, holding
examinations and awarding medical degrees and for ancillary matters;
Be it enacted by the Provincial
Assembly of the Punjab as follows:
CHAPTER III
OFFICERS OF THE
UNIVERSITY
8. Officers of the
University. The following shall be the
officers of the University:-
(a) Chancellor;
(b) Pro-Chancellor;
(c) Vice
Chancellor;
(d) Pro-Vice
Chancellor;
(e) Deans;
(f) Chairpersons;
(g) Registrar;
(h) Treasurer;
(i) Controller of Examinations;
(j) Librarian;
(k) Auditor; and
(l) such other
persons as may be prescribed.
